---
layout: base
title: Al's 11ty Website
description: The homepage of my website.... it's work in progress okay?! Jesus....
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Home
  order: 1
---

<section class="content-showcase" aria-label="Latest Publications">
  <div class="content-showcase__grid">
    
    <div class="content-column">
      <h2 class="content-column__title">Recent Articles</h2>
      <ul class="custom-menu__list" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
        {%- set postList = collections.posts if collections.posts and collections.posts.length > 0 else collections.all | head(-3) -%}
        {%- for post in postList | reverse | limit(3) -%}
          {% reviewCard post %} <!-- Single-line calling component with fallback -->
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-column">
      <h2 class="content-column__title">Latest Reviews</h2>
      <ul class="custom-menu__list" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">
        {%- for review in collections.automatedReviewTransitions | limit(3) -%}
          {% reviewCard review, loop.index %} <!-- Automatically passes loops tokens for View Transitions -->
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>